<title>USA: Franklin, Ind., won by City Securities.</title>
<headline>Franklin, Ind., won by City Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>City Securities Corp said it won $2.500 million of Franklin, Ind., general obligation bonds of 1997 with a net interest cost of 55.106 percent.</p>
</text>
